 "description": "2U single-sided horizontal cable manager, FS SKU #29039: a black ABS finger duct with a detachable cover, the two-unit CMH-SFD1U. A base plate between the rack ears carries a row of fingers along its top edge and another along its bottom, twelve slots in each a cable is laid in through, and the cover clips over the finger tips to close a channel about 70 mm high that runs the width of the rack. Two pass-through holes in the base lead cables to the other side.",
